sign:0:0:0:0:1000:1000:Welcome! You're probably wondering why you're here. Well, you see, 1000 feet below is the temple of the Infinite Spirit. We have no idea how we found the temple, but we need people like you to help us in identifying just what this entity is. North of you is an Elevator. Take it down to the temple and let us know what you find!:sign3.ogg
